-The planning block contains selected data as of its day and time zone; an item-specific time zone overrides the block's. A date without a clock time is an all-day plan or a date-only deadline, not midnight. Empty or omitted fields/lists mean no supplied data, not inactivity. Older clients may supply the same facts in a text overview.
